Package: ensemblelink
Title: EnsembleLink: Accurate Record Linkage Without Training Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Noah", "Dasanaike", email = "noahdasanaike@g.harvard.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Performs fuzzy record linkage using four-expert agreement fusion. Candidates
    are retrieved by an embedding-plus-TF-IDF ensemble and scored by a two-model
    cross-encoder reranker ensemble, a CSLS-corrected dense cosine, a sparse TF-IDF
    cosine, and Jaro-Winkler similarity, then fused without labels. Requires no labeled
    training data and outperforms supervised methods on standard benchmarks. Uses a
    Python backend via reticulate.
